"en":"It is named after Pele, the goddess of volcanoes and fire.","zh":null}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"top\"><nav aria-label=\"Documentation\"></nav><div><section aria-labelledby=\"how-it-works\"><header><h2 id=\"how-it-works\">它是如何运作的</h2></header><p>Write Mermaid syntax, Pele renders it to SVG. Try editing the example below.</p><div data-code-block=\"\" data-home-editor=\"mermaid\"><p>Mermaid</p><pre><code data-language=\"mermaid\"><span><span><span>flowchart</span> <span>TD</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>A</span><span>[</span><span>Mermaid text</span><span>]</span> <span>--&gt;</span> <span>B</span><span>{</span><span>Flowchart?</span><span>}</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>B</span> <span>--</span><span> Yes </span><span>--&gt;</span> <span>C</span><span>[</span><span>Pele</span><span>]</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>B</span> <span>--</span><span> No </span><span>--&gt;</span> <span>D</span><span>[</span><span>Mermaid</span><span>]</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>C</span> <span>--&gt;</span> <span>E</span><span>([</span><span>SVG</span><span>])</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>D</span> <span>--&gt;</span> <span>E</span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>Use CSS variables to set colors and fonts. Color changes apply without re-rendering.</p><div><div data-code-block=\"\" data-home-editor=\"css\"><p><span>CSS</span><span></span></p><pre><code data-language=\"css\"><span><span><span>.pele </span><span>{</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>--pele-bg</span><span>: </span><span>#fffcf0</span><span>;</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>--pele-fg</span><span>: </span><span>#100f0f</span><span>;</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>--pele-muted</span><span>: </span><span>#6f6e69</span><span>;</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>--pele-line</span><span>: </span><span>#100f0f</span><span>;</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>--pele-surface</span><span>: </span><span>#f2f0e5</span><span>;</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>--pele-surface-alt</span><span>: </span><span>#e6e4d9</span><span>;</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>--pele-border</span><span>: </span><span>#cecdc3</span><span>;</span></span></span><span><span><span>}</span></span></span></code></pre></div><div data-pele-theme=\"light\"><p><span>Pele</span></p><figure aria-label=\"Flowchart rendered by Pele in a light theme\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 298 212\" width=\"298\" height=\"212\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;--_bg:var(--pele-bg,#fff);--_fg:var(--pele-fg,#1f1f1f);--_m:var(--pele-muted,#6e6e6e);--_l:var(--pele-line,#1f1f1f);--_s:var(--pele-surface,#f3f3f3);--_a:var(--pele-surface-alt,#e6e6e6);--_b:var(--pele-border,#8a8a8a);--_c:var(--pele-accent,#5b7bd5);color:var(--_fg);--_r:var(--pele-radius,4px);--_fm:var(--pele-font-mono,monospace);font:16px sans-serif;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;direction:ltr;font-family:var(--pele-font,sans-serif)\" fill=\"var(--_fg)\" role=\"graphics-document document\" aria-roledescription=\"flowchart\"><g><g data-id=\"Themes\"><rect x=\"158.69\" y=\"8\" width=\"130.69\" height=\"196\" fill=\"var(--_a)\" fill-opacity=\"0.5\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\" /><text fill=\"var(--_m)\" x=\"201.58\" y=\"33.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Themes</text></g></g><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--_l)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><g data-id=\"L_A_B_0\"><path d=\"M110.69,108C134.69,108 134.69,72 158.69,72L191.69,72\" /><path d=\"M198.69,72L190.69,75.36L190.69,68.64Z\" fill=\"var(--_l)\" stroke=\"none\" /></g><g data-id=\"L_A_C_0\"><path d=\"M110.69,124C134.69,124 134.69,160 158.69,160L191.69,160\" /><path d=\"M198.69,160L190.69,163.36L190.69,156.64Z\" fill=\"var(--_l)\" stroke=\"none\" /></g></g><g><g data-id=\"A\" transform=\"translate(59.34,116)\"><rect x=\"-51.34\" y=\"-24\" width=\"102.69\" height=\"48\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\" /><text x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Variables</text></g><g data-id=\"B\" transform=\"translate(234.03,72)\"><rect x=\"-35.34\" y=\"-24\" width=\"70.69\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" /><text x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Light</text></g><g data-id=\"C\" transform=\"translate(233.58,160)\"><rect x=\"-34.89\" y=\"-24\" width=\"69.78\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" /><text x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dark</text></g></g></svg></figure></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\"why-pele\"><header><h2 id=\"why-pele\">Why Pele?</h2><p>Zero dependencies, 6× smaller, and up to 500× faster than Mermaid.js. Pele supports every diagram type built into Mermaid 12.1.0.</p></header><div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"why-pele\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><td></td><th scope=\"col\">Pele</th><th scope=\"col\">Mermaid.js</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Bundle size gzip</td><td>230 kB</td><td>1.6 MB</td></tr><tr><td>Render time</td><td>0.05–0.3 ms</td><td>6–82 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Direct dependencies</td><td>0</td><td>23</td></tr><tr><td>Small screens</td><td>Adapts the layout</td><td>Scales the diagram</td></tr><tr><td>Theming</td><td>CSS variables</td><td>Theme configuration</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\"install-title\"><header><h2 id=\"install-title\">Pele in your app</h2></header><p>Add Pele to your app using the API.</p><div id=\"install-npm\" data-install-panel=\"npm\"><figure data-code-block=\"\"><span></span><pre><code data-language=\"shell\"><span><span><span>npm</span> install pele</span></span></code></pre></figure></div><p>Pass Mermaid syntax to render() and insert the returned SVG into your page.</p><figure data-code-block=\"\"><span></span><pre><code data-language=\"ts\"><span><span><span>import</span> <span>{</span> <span>render</span> <span>}</span> <span>from</span> <span>'</span><span>pele</span><span>'</span><span>;</span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span><span>const</span> <span>{</span> <span>svg</span> <span>}</span> <span>=</span> <span>render</span><span>(</span><span>`</span><span>flowchart LR</span></span></span><span><span><span>  A[Mermaid text] --&gt; B[SVG]</span><span>`</span><span>)</span><span>;</span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span><span>document</span><span>.</span><span>querySelector</span><span>(</span><span>'</span><span>#diagram</span><span>'</span><span>)</span><span>.</span><span>innerHTML</span> <span>=</span> <span>svg</span><span>;</span></span></span></code></pre></figure></section><section aria-labelledby=\"explore-title\"><header><h2 id=\"explore-title\">探索</h2></header><nav aria-label=\"Documentation\"><a href=\"/examples\"><h3>示例</h3><p>Browse supported diagram types.</p></a><a href=\"/api\"><h3>API</h3><p>Render diagrams in your app.</p></a><a href=\"/theming\"><h3>Theming</h3><p>Set colors and fonts with CSS variables.</p></a><a href=\"/compatibility\"><h3>兼容性</h3><p>Compare syntax, layout, and features with Mermaid.</p></a></nav></section><section aria-labelledby=\"pele-in-use\"><header><p></p><h2 id=\"pele-in-use\">Pele in use</h2><p></p><p>Pele is open source, developed for Obsidian to render diagrams quickly and match your theme. It is named after Pele, the goddess of volcanoes and fire.</p></header></section></div></div></div>"}